### ================================================================
### journey-error.http — 개인/귀가 여정 API 에러 케이스
### 매 테스트 전 서버를 재기동(DB create)하여 초기화할 것
### ================================================================


### ================================================================
### STEP 1. 회원가입 + 로그인 (독립 실행용)
### ================================================================

### 0-1. 회원가입
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hero@cau.ac.kr",
  "password": "password123!",
  "nickname": "영웅개발자",
  "home_name": "우리집",
  "home_address": "서울특별시 동작구 흑석로 84",
  "home_lat": 37.50490,
  "home_lng": 126.96147,
  "preparation_time": 10
}

### 0-2. 로그인 → accessToken 저장
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hero@cau.ac.kr",
  "password": "password123!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.access_token);
%}


### ================================================================
### 개인 여정 생성 에러
### ================================================================

### E-1. plan_date 누락 → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/journeys/personal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "target_time": "2026-05-30T22:00:00",
  "dest_name": "강남역",
  "dest_address": "서울특별시 강남구 강남대로 396",
  "dest_lat": 37.49794,
  "dest_lng": 127.02759,
  "transport_type": "TRANSIT",
  "repeat_days": 0
}

### E-2. target_time 누락 → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/journeys/personal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
